	    ld.so.1: go1: fatal: /var/gcc/regression/master/11.4-gcc/build/gcc/go1: hardware capability (CA_SUNW_HW_2) unsupported: 0x4000000  [ SHA1 ]
	    gccgo: fatal error: Killed signal terminated program go1

