		* sha1.c: If HAVE_X86_SHA1_HW_SUPPORT is defined, include x86intrin.h
		and cpuid.h.
		(sha1_hw_process_bytes, sha1_hw_process_block,
		sha1_choose_process_bytes): New functions.
