	- tui_nofocus_window,
	- tui_oneline_window,
	- tui_nobox_window,
	- tui_norefresh_window, and
	- tui_always_visible_window.

	The changes are only a refactoring, apart from adding the "final", which does
	limit the range of behaviours for subclasses.

	Tested on x86_64-linux.

