	to the relocation function ought to be parenthesized. Enforcing this
	then also eliminates an inconsistency in that

		lui	t0, %hi sym
		lui	t0, %hi 0x1000

	were accepted, but

		lui	t0, %hi +sym
		lui	t0, %hi -0x1000

	were not.

