	[gdb/testsuite] Use set in lmap in gdb.dwarf2/dw2-abs-hi-pc.exp
	In gdb.dwarf2/dw2-abs-hi-pc.exp we do:
	...
	set sources [lmap i $sources { expr { "$srcdir/$subdir/$i" } }]
	...

