	* auxv_parse gets:

	/vol/src/gnu/gdb/hg/master/dist/gdb/procfs.c:144:7: error: int
	procfs_target::auxv_parse(gdb_byte**, gdb_byte*, CORE_ADDR*, CORE_ADDR*)
