	    * testsuite/gas/riscv/x-thead-fmemidx.d: Likewise.
	    * testsuite/gas/riscv/x-thead-fmemidx.s: Likewise.
	opcodes/
	    * riscv-opc.c (riscv_opcodes): Updated since rd need to be float register.

