	https://libre-soc.org/openpower/isa/simplev/

	ppc/svp64: support svshape instruction
	https://libre-soc.org/openpower/sv/
	https://libre-soc.org/openpower/sv/remap/#svshape
	https://libre-soc.org/openpower/isa/simplev/

