	gdb: work around negative DW_AT_data_member_location GCC 11 bug
	g++ 11.1.0 has a bug where it will emit a negative
	DW_AT_data_member_location in some cases:

	    $ cat test.cpp
	    #include <memory>

	    int
	    main()
	    {
