2022-01-18  Simon Marchi  <simon.marchi@efficios.com>

	bfd/elf64-ppc.c: fix clang -Wbitwise-instead-of-logical warning in ppc64_elf_check_init_fini
	I see this error with clang-14:

	      CC       elf64-ppc.lo
