		(record_operand_error_with_data): Update after change to
		aarch64_operand_error.
		(output_operand_error_record): Likewise.  Handle
		AARCH64_OPDE_A_SHOULD_FOLLOW_B and AARCH64_OPDE_EXPECTED_A_AFTER_B.
