	    <22b>   DW_AT_type        : <0x231>
	 <1><231>: Abbrev Number: 4 (DW_TAG_array_type)
	    <232>   DW_AT_type        : <0x105>
	 <2><23a>: Abbrev Number: 16 (DW_TAG_subrange_type)
